alphaTab 1.8.4 — music notation and guitar tablature rendering. tab-view.js uses it to draw and
play the AlphaTex tab the app exports; it loads only when a tab is first shown. The version is in
the folder name so a phone can never mix cached files from two releases.

Files, copied unmodified from the npm package @coderline/alphatab@1.8.4 (dist/), renamed to the
names the library imports itself by:
  alphaTab.mjs          ← dist/alphaTab.min.mjs
  alphaTab.core.mjs     ← dist/alphaTab.core.min.mjs
  alphaTab.worker.mjs   ← dist/alphaTab.worker.min.mjs   (rendering worker)
  alphaTab.worklet.mjs  ← dist/alphaTab.worklet.min.mjs  (audio worklet)
  font/Bravura.woff2, font/Bravura.woff, font/Bravura-OFL.txt  ← dist/font/
  soundfont/sonivox.sf3, soundfont/LICENSE                      ← dist/soundfont/
Source: https://github.com/coderline/alphaTab · https://www.npmjs.com/package/@coderline/alphatab

